{"type":"message","id":"c06a46df","parentId":"3a527e87","timestamp":"2026-03-13T01:30:53.170Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 9:30 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773365453169}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c1c4578","parentId":"c06a46df","timestamp":"2026-03-13T01:31:02.924Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个定时任务，要求我执行自动进化任务。让我理解一下任务：\n\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n当前时间是 2026年3月13日（星期五）上午9:30\n\n首先，我需要使用 clawhub skill 来搜索和安装技能。让我先读取 clawhub skill 文件来了解如何使用它。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行这个定时进化任务。首先加载 clawhub 技能了解如何使用。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9feedf966ae640d3b1a7179f","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":182,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15639,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.0005824000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013325799999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773365453170}}
{"type":"message","id":"4479473e","parentId":"1c1c4578","timestamp":"2026-03-13T01:31:02.931Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9feedf966ae640d3b1a7179f","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773365462930}}
{"type":"message","id":"c7dcbe98","parentId":"4479473e","timestamp":"2026-03-13T01:31:12.520Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我现在知道如何使用 clawhub CLI 了。让我开始执行任务：\n\n1. 首先搜索相关关键词的技能\n2. 筛选符合条件的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成报告\n\n让我先搜索这些关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n我需要执行多个搜索命令来找到相关技能。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在开始搜索 ClawHub 上的高效技能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_68956736e67b4ac8920daa9d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"calendar\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"calendar\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7d3e55d57f8342208a85187d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"task\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"task\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5fc0d5ee9eb34ef99e0e9dbe","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"document\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"document\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_864afd6a9d22475c81acd6ba","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"meeting\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"meeting\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6b107c2770ba4887bfe83e2e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"email\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"email\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ab7ed6536b684a18ba3caff6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"notes\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"notes\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_970cd864dd274aae8974a5a3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"productivity\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"productivity\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a631678981f54317bf2fb852","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"automation\" --json 2>/dev/null || clawhub search \"automation\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":661,"output":329,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16414,"c